;; root (proposals/, legacy/, custom/) are classed by what they test (WAS5 (a)), a non-pass's reason prefixed by bin/repr-wasm wast
;; (arbace.repr.wasm.wast/tag-of): proposals beyond Wasm 3.0 deferred by WAS4 (a), the legacy exceptions run since WA8 (none left), the branch hints'
;; annotations not built.
